          "levels": [],
          "description": "<p>Galvantula is faster than <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/araquanid/nu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Araquanid</a>, spreads status easily, and can drop foes's stats. However, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/cinccino/nu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Cinccino</a>'s Tidy Up and multi-hit moves can blow right past Galvantula, making it an unreliable Sticky Web setter.</p>",
